{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00169",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.86,
      "end_seconds": 7.75,
      "duration_seconds": 6.89,
      "text": "I mean, um, hi there, is it alright if I come in now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.58,
      "end_seconds": 15.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Yes, do sit. Tell me what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 17.5,
      "end_seconds": 25.58,
      "duration_seconds": 8.08,
      "text": "Mainly fever and joint pains. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.98,
      "end_seconds": 35.81,
      "duration_seconds": 8.83,
      "text": "So, can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.55,
      "end_seconds": 46.18,
      "duration_seconds": 6.63,
      "text": "Well, it happens every other day. I get some relief from paracetamol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.52,
      "end_seconds": 50.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "Does it come along with anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.21,
      "end_seconds": 62.67,
      "duration_seconds": 10.46,
      "text": "A headache goes along with it, um, most of the time. Um, and I've been feeling wiped out as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.73,
      "end_seconds": 66.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "How bad is it, would you say?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.27,
      "end_seconds": 74.61,
      "duration_seconds": 6.34,
      "text": "It's mild, honestly. Okay, so the headache? That's been since last weekend."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.67,
      "end_seconds": 81.46,
      "duration_seconds": 5.79,
      "text": "Okay, any cough, red eyes, neck stiffness or vomiting at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.16,
      "end_seconds": 91.57,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "No, no cough, red eyes, neck stiffness or vomiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.91,
      "end_seconds": 98.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "Any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.45,
      "end_seconds": 102.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Well, no, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.17,
      "end_seconds": 106.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.69,
      "end_seconds": 109.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "No problems with breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.08,
      "end_seconds": 114.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.76,
      "end_seconds": 125.9,
      "duration_seconds": 11.14,
      "text": "I eat out quite a lot, to be honest. Yes, I live on my own. I work night shifts at a warehouse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.61,
      "end_seconds": 149.64,
      "duration_seconds": 5.03,
      "text": "Before I prescribe anything, any allergies? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.8,
      "end_seconds": 154.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "I've never been told I have allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.38,
      "end_seconds": 158.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Have you got any chronic problems?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.72,
      "end_seconds": 162.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "I've had high blood pressure, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.67,
      "end_seconds": 168.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.47,
      "end_seconds": 175.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "Telmisartan. I take it 40 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.37,
      "end_seconds": 177.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.16,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.39,
      "end_seconds": 182.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "No, you know, never had any surgery."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.41,
      "end_seconds": 186.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Is there a family history of anything significant?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.54,
      "end_seconds": 189.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "My father was diabetic."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.92,
      "end_seconds": 202.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Can I take your vitals now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.84,
      "end_seconds": 212.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "Hold still for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.13,
      "end_seconds": 231.02,
      "duration_seconds": 6.89,
      "text": "Okay: height 166 centimetres, weight 74 kilos, pressure 110 over 77, heart rate 88."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.52,
      "end_seconds": 236.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Okay, I need to examine you for this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.79,
      "end_seconds": 241.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Take your time, no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.46,
      "end_seconds": 255.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "Both wrists and several finger joints are puffy and tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.64,
      "end_seconds": 262.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "Right, you can sit back down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.75,
      "end_seconds": 286.41,
      "duration_seconds": 11.66,
      "text": "So where does that leave us? It fits best with a viral fever with joint involvement, possibly chikungunya. An early inflammatory arthritis is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 288.07,
      "end_seconds": 290.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Do you think it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.26,
      "end_seconds": 305.82,
      "duration_seconds": 14.56,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a viral fever with joint involvement, possibly chikungunya is my leading thought, not anything worse. I want a full blood count done, that's for fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 307.67,
      "end_seconds": 311.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "We have a slot Friday at 2 pm, if that works."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.6,
      "end_seconds": 317.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "I'm sending you for a dengue test because of fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 318.79,
      "end_seconds": 320.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.06,
      "end_seconds": 331.03,
      "duration_seconds": 9.97,
      "text": "I'll start you on paracetamol, 650 milligrams, three times a day, for five days. That's for fever and joint pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 333.04,
      "end_seconds": 336.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Is that safe with my other things?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.78,
      "end_seconds": 359.86,
      "duration_seconds": 22.08,
      "text": "Avoid anti-inflammatory painkillers until we know it isn't dengue. Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest. I'd like you back after the results are back. So, ask me anything before you go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 361.52,
      "end_seconds": 363.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "Thanks so much, doctor."
    }
  ]
}